  "Package": "biodbHmdb",
  "Title": "biodbHmdb, a library for connecting to the HMDB Database",
  "Version": "1.16.0",
  "Authors@R": "c(person(\"Pierrick\", \"Roger\", email=\"pierrick.roger@cea.fr\", role=c(\"aut\", \"cre\"), comment=c(ORCID=\"0000-0001-8177-4873\")))",
  "Description": "The biodbHmdb library is an extension of the biodb\nframework package that provides access to the HMDB Metabolites\ndatabase. It allows to download the whole HMDB Metabolites\ndatabase locally, access entries and search for entries by name\nor description. A future version of this package will also\ninclude a search by mass and mass spectra annotation.",
